          "id": "6141249959"
        },
        "body": "thanks for the request, and sorry it's been so long! I'm going to close this as it's been a while, but you're very welcome to open a pull request to list the module directly. please make sure it supports nuxt 4+ first, as nuxt v3 is now EOL.\n\nfrom a fork of this repo:\n\n```bash\npnpm install\npnpm sync gsap hypernym-studio/nuxt-gsap\n```\n\nthat creates the module's `.yml` file in `modules/`. set `category` to one of the values in `lib/categories.ts`, optionally add an icon to `icons/`, and open a PR. more details in the [contribution guide](https://github.com/nuxt/modules#contribution)."
      },
